OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain 'exciting and
OL,4,Aenjoyable' to watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents braved torrential downpours
OL,7,Fto cheer the Tour of Britain women's
OL,8,Fcycling race as it visited Lancashire
OL,9,Ffor the first time.
OL,11,FStage two of the race is passing
OL,12,Fthrough more than 70 miles (113km) of
OL,13,Fthe county, starting in Clitheroe and
OL,14,Ffinishing in Blackpool.
OL,16,FRiders will tackle Waddington Fell and
OL,17,Fthe Nick o' Pendle before passing
OL,18,Fthrough areas including Sabden,
OL,19,FWhalley, Hurst Green, Longridge,
OL,20,FBroughton, Weeton and Lytham, followed
OL,21,Fby a sprint to the finish line next to
OL,22,FBlackpool's Mirror Ball.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
