OL,3,GNEWSATour of Britain 'exciting and
OL,4,Aenjoyable' to watch live
OL,5,
OL,6,FClitheroe resident, Joan Fletcher, said
OL,7,Fthe race was "so exciting and
OL,8,Fenjoyable" to watch. The town also
OL,9,Fhosted the men's race in 2015, which
OL,10,Fwas the last time the Tour came to the
OL,11,Fcounty.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
